{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12681","headline":"与党侍御 · 元结","name":"与党侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆坐吾独欢，或问欢爲谁。\n高人党茂宗，复来官宪司。\n昔吾顺元和，与世行自遗。\n茂宗正作吏，日有趋走疲。\n及吾污冠冕，茂宗方矫时。\n诮吾顺让者，乃是干进资。\n今将问茂宗，茂宗欲何辞。\n若云吾无心，此来复何爲。\n若云吾有羞，於此还见嗤。\n谁言万类心，闲之不可窥。\n吾欲喻茂宗，茂宗宜听之。\n长辕有修辙，驭者令尔驰。\n山谷安可怨，筋力当自悲。\n嗟嗟党茂宗，可爲识者规。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}